@startuml ArchiSurance Component Overview
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Component.puml

title ArchiSurance — Application Component Overview

package "Application Layer" {
  [CRM System] as CRM <<ApplicationComponent>>
  [Claims Management Platform] as CMP <<ApplicationComponent>>
  [Risk Engine] as RE <<ApplicationComponent>>
  [Fraud Detection Engine] as FDE <<ApplicationComponent>>
  [Policy Administration System] as PAS <<ApplicationComponent>>
  [Customer Self-Service Portal] as CSP <<ApplicationComponent>>
  [API Gateway] as GW <<ApplicationComponent>>
  [Billing System] as BS <<ApplicationComponent>>
  [Data Warehouse] as DW <<ApplicationComponent>>
  [Notification Service] as NS <<ApplicationComponent>>
  [Enterprise Service Bus] as ESB <<ApplicationComponent>>
}

package "Technology Layer" {
  [Kubernetes] as K8S <<SystemSoftware>>
  [PostgreSQL 15] as PG <<SystemSoftware>>
  [Apache Kafka] as KAFKA <<SystemSoftware>>
  ' INTENTIONAL DEVIATION: Diagram shows Risk Engine connected to PostgreSQL
  ' but Terraform provisions Oracle for some services
  RE --> PG : accesses
}

' Serving relationships
CMP --> CRM : serves (customer data)
GW --> CSP : routes to
CMP --> RE : calls (risk scoring)
CMP --> FDE : calls (fraud check)
ESB --> CMP : integrates
ESB --> BS : integrates
ESB --> PAS : integrates

' Infrastructure
K8S --> CMP : hosts
K8S --> RE : hosts
K8S --> FDE : hosts
K8S --> CSP : hosts

KAFKA --> ESB : streams events
KAFKA --> FDE : streams events

@enduml
